WEBVTT

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.270
that fundamentally changed everything.

00:07:30.294 --> 00:07:33.095
Suddenly we had Netscape, we had Yahoo.

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:35.976
And we had, indeed,
the entire dot-com bubble.

00:07:36.688 --> 00:07:38.568
(Laughter)

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:40.743
Not to worry though,

00:07:40.767 --> 00:07:43.342
that was quickly rescued
by the iPod, Facebook

00:07:43.366 --> 00:07:45.469
and, indeed, Angry Birds.

00:07:45.493 --> 00:07:47.469
(Laughter)

00:07:47.865 --> 00:07:50.391
Look, this is where we are today.

00:07:50.415 --> 00:07:53.205
This is the genomic revolution today.
This is where we are.

00:07:53.229 --> 00:07:54.809
What I'd like you to consider is:

00:07:54.833 --> 00:07:56.238
What does it mean

00:07:56.262 --> 00:07:59.619
when these dots don't represent
the individual bases of your genome,

00:07:59.643 --> 00:08:02.494
but they connect to genomes
all across the planet?